   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "On motion to recommit with instructions Failed by the Yeas and Nays: 148 - 270 (Roll no. 576).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8A000",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-18",
   "actionTime": "10:47:26",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question on the motion to recommit with instructions was ordered without objection.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-18",
   "actionTime": "10:39:34",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Floor summary: DEBATE - The House proceeded with ten minutes of debate on the Crapo motion to recommit with instructions. The instructions contained in the motion require the bill to be reported back to the House with provisions that result in assurances that no net job losses will occur as meaured by existing Department of Interior economic models.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-18",
   "actionTime": "10:38:41",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Natural Resources Committee",
     "systemCode": "hsii00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hsii00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Crapo moved to recommit with instructions to Natural Resources. (consideration: CR H10060-10062)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H34400",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-18",
   "actionTime": "10:37:43",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House adopted the amendment in the nature of a substitute as agreed to by the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-18",
   "actionTime": "10:37:13",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32600",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-18",
   "actionTime": "10:37:07",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House rose from the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union to report H.R. 322.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-18",
   "actionTime": "10:36:10",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered as unfinished business.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32050",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-18",
   "actionTime": "10:23:38",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House resolved into Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union for further consideration.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-18",
   "actionTime": "10:23:20",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H10054-10063)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32700",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-16",
   "actionTime": "19:27:44",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union rises leaving H.R. 322 as unfinished business.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-16",
   "actionTime": "14:43:41",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "GENERAL DEBATE - The Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of general debate.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32400",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-16",
   "actionTime": "14:43:33",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The Speaker designated the Honorable Barbara B. Kennelly to act as Chairwoman of the Committee.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32020",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-16",
   "actionTime": "14:43:32",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "House resolved itself into the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union pursuant to H. Res. 303 and Rule XXIII.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-16",
   "actionTime": "14:42:17",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 322 with 1 hour of general debate. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit with or without instructions. It shall be in order to consider as an original bill for the purpose of amendment under the five-minute rule the amendment in the nature of a substitute recommended by the Committee on Natural Resources now printed in the bill. Measure will be read by title. Bill is open to amendments.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-16",
   "actionTime": "14:42:12",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 303. (consideration: CR H9740-9799)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L220",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-16",
   "actionTime": "14:42:00",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule H. Res. 303 passed House.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
   "actionDate": "1993-11-09",
   "actionTime": "20:55:32",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 303 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 322 with 1 hour of general debate. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit with or without instructions. It shall be in order to consider as an original bill for the purpose of amendment under the five-minute rule the amendment in the nature of a substitute recommended by the Committee on Natural Resources now printed in the bill. Measure will be read by title. Bill is open to amendments.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
